; abrazileira.pt -> 301 redirect to https://abrazileira.com (via Cloudflare Redirect Rule)
; Import in Cloudflare: DNS > Records > Import, and CHECK "Proxy imported DNS records" (orange cloud).
; 192.0.2.1 / 100:: are placeholders: traffic never reaches them, the proxied redirect answers first.
$ORIGIN abrazileira.pt.
$TTL 3600
@    IN A     192.0.2.1
@    IN AAAA  100::
www  IN CNAME abrazileira.pt.
